<title>SWITZERLAND: Novartis revamps phamaceutical management.</title>
<headline>Novartis revamps phamaceutical management.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novartis AG said it had created a new regional management organisation for its pharmaceuticals division to speed the pace of decision-making and enhance flexibility.</p>
<p>The United States, Japan, Europe, the Americas and Asia Pacific will now, along with global marketing, report directly to Pierre Douaze, head of the pharmaceuticals division, thus eliminating two layers of management, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
